=== REASONING ===
fn_driving_stats(vehicle_id, period) returned: distance, drives, energy_kwh, drive_min.
  - distance = convert_distance(SUM(distance_mi))
  - drives = COUNT(*)
  - energy_kwh = SUM(energy_used_kwh)
  - drive_min = SUM(duration_min)
Period mapping:
  'today'  -> start_ts >= DATE_TRUNC('day', NOW())
  'week'   -> start_ts >= DATE_TRUNC('week', NOW())
  'month'  -> start_ts >= DATE_TRUNC('month', NOW())
  'all'    -> no time filter

fn_weekly_summary → same as fn_driving_stats with 7-day window
fn_driving_week_over_week → CTE with ISODOW grouping, current vs previous week
fn_driving_daily_breakdown → GROUP BY DATE(start_ts) for last 7 days
fn_weekly_activity → UNION ALL of drives + charging_sessions

Per ADR-002: COALESCE with 0 for SUM aggregates.
All queries include time filters for chunk pruning (except 'all' which is intentionally unbounded).
convert_distance() used for all distance outputs to respect user unit preference.

